+1. Use `/plan`, Ctrl+Alt+P, or `--plan` to enter planning.
+2. Ask the agent to inspect the repository and submit `plan_submit({ steps: [...] })`.
+   Every step must contain non-whitespace text. Each successful submission replaces
+   all steps and increments the revision, preserving the supplied strings exactly.
+3. After the agent settles, review the displayed plan and choose Execute, Stay, or
+   Refine. Execute approves the identity and revision displayed in that dialog.
+   A revision submitted while a dialog is open makes that old approval stale.
+4. Approval restores the exact tool selection from before planning and starts one
+   execution request automatically. `/todos` displays `[DONE:n]` progress without
+   changing the authoritative plan or its approval.
 
-## Commands
